1
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:52,440
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,650
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:53,650 --> 00:00:55,920
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,920
=Episode 19=

5
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:04,719
Don't push your luck.

6
00:01:06,439 --> 00:01:07,120
Let go!

7
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,319
Let go of me!

8
00:01:13,439 --> 00:01:14,079
You asking for it!

9
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:22,760
It's okay.

10
00:01:26,719 --> 00:01:27,319
It's okay.

11
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:30,040
No more of this filth.

12
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:31,799
We'll have your back from now on.

13
00:01:34,239 --> 00:01:34,719
Mona.

14
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:39,640
Am I dirty?

15
00:01:43,319 --> 00:01:44,680
Whenever I see that creep

16
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,200
and this place,

17
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:50,439
I feel filthy.

18
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:55,519
I feel like I'll never be able to
wash this off.

19
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,000
It's okay.

20
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,439
You're all so clean.

21
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,680
I don't deserve to be your friend.

22
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,799
This place is filthy, not you.

23
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,640
You're cleaner than

24
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,280
anyone else here.

25
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:09,520
And braver.

26
00:02:10,439 --> 00:02:11,080
Look at me.

27
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:13,840
Got it?

28
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:21,639
I'm dirty.

29
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:24,159
I'm around these creeps every day.

30
00:02:24,159 --> 00:02:25,719
I'm filthy.

31
00:02:27,199 --> 00:02:28,199
It's all over now.

32
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:29,000
From now on, you've got us.

33
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,879
It's not safe here now.

34
00:02:40,199 --> 00:02:40,719
Let's get out first.

35
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:42,400
Go.

36
00:03:03,759 --> 00:03:05,080
You little creep.

37
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:06,439
You've got some nerve, huh?

38
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,319
Boss Natuo.

39
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,479
Haven't seen you in a few days.

40
00:03:10,479 --> 00:03:11,680
What happened to your eye?

41
00:03:12,039 --> 00:03:13,919
See something you shouldn't have

42
00:03:13,919 --> 00:03:14,639
and lose an eye?

43
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:18,840
You asking for trouble?

44
00:03:19,159 --> 00:03:19,800
Get him!

45
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:30,520
Boss!

46
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:34,199
Natuo.

47
00:03:34,599 --> 00:03:36,680
Missing an eye,
you're blind to the situation.

48
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:40,439
Ms. Layla has the document
signed by Mr. Songcai.

49
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,120
I'm here on her behalf
to take over Grand Royal.

50
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:47,360
You want to take Grand Royal from me?

51
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,560
Dream on!

52
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,199
You think

53
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:52,879
bringing this little crew

54
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:54,199
is enough to scare me?

55
00:03:57,319 --> 00:03:58,439
None of you

56
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,520
are getting out of here alive today.

57
00:04:03,639 --> 00:04:05,120
Surprised, Mian?

58
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,000
I've planted bombs

59
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,400
all over this building.

60
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:09,960
Want my turf?

61
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:10,960
Fine.

62
00:04:11,439 --> 00:04:12,560
Then we all go up in flames.

63
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:15,120
I'd rather take you down with me

64
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,759
than let you have it.

65
00:04:19,639 --> 00:04:20,240
Hey!

66
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,240
What are you two doing here?

67
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,000
Stop!

68
00:04:23,759 --> 00:04:24,279
Go!

69
00:04:24,279 --> 00:04:24,800
I'll handle this.

70
00:04:25,319 --> 00:04:26,079
Be careful.

71
00:04:28,759 --> 00:04:29,399
Put the case down.

72
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,560
This is all you have left.

73
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:16,560
Can you really bring yourself
to blow it up?

74
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,600
If you're taking it from me,

75
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:21,439
I'd rather blow it up.

76
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:23,360
We all go down together.

77
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,959
You don't strike me as the type
to throw your life away.

78
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:27,680
Really?

79
00:05:31,639 --> 00:05:32,399
Northeast.

80
00:05:36,319 --> 00:05:36,720
You!

81
00:05:38,199 --> 00:05:39,560
Calm down.

82
00:05:40,879 --> 00:05:41,839
Touch me,

83
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:43,920
and the second I let go,

84
00:05:44,199 --> 00:05:46,879
we all die.

85
00:05:50,399 --> 00:05:51,439
That little blast

86
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:53,360
was just an appetizer.

87
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:56,240
The main course comes next.

88
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:57,399
Mian.

89
00:05:58,680 --> 00:06:01,040
How about we play a game

90
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,279
again?

91
00:06:03,639 --> 00:06:04,639
The green one

92
00:06:05,319 --> 00:06:06,160
is under your feet.

93
00:06:07,519 --> 00:06:08,240
The red one...

94
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,040
Big guys.

95
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,279
They take everyone with them.

96
00:06:13,439 --> 00:06:14,279
Next.

97
00:06:14,759 --> 00:06:15,879
Which one should I choose?

98
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,680
Do not move!

99
00:06:29,879 --> 00:06:32,240
Or I'll set off both.

100
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,279
Hard to make your choice?

101
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,600
Let me help you.

102
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:39,439
This one,

103
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,279
and you live.

104
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,160
No way.

105
00:06:43,839 --> 00:06:44,240
Boss!

106
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:45,399
Don't worry about us.

107
00:06:45,759 --> 00:06:46,360
Natuo.

108
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:48,000
If you've got the guts, come at me.

109
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,480
No, no, no.

110
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,839
I want you to make the choice.

111
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:53,560
Mian,

112
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,759
aren't you all about brotherhood?

113
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:57,800
Let's see

114
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,680
what your so-called brotherhood

115
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,240
is really worth.

116
00:07:02,879 --> 00:07:03,800
Or maybe...

117
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:05,800
you kill him.

118
00:07:06,439 --> 00:07:07,639
Once Mian is dead,

119
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:10,399
I'll disarm every bomb

120
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,600
and let you walk out.

121
00:07:12,759 --> 00:07:13,800
Trade his life

122
00:07:14,279 --> 00:07:15,639
for all of yours.

123
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:17,120
Pretty good deal.

124
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:25,560
Mian.

125
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:28,000
Aren't you good at rallying people?

126
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:30,920
Then let the people you've rallied

127
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:33,319
decide if you live or die.

128
00:07:34,199 --> 00:07:34,800
Piggies!

129
00:07:35,279 --> 00:07:36,160
Kill him,

130
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:37,519
and I'll let you live.

131
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:38,240
Not a chance!

132
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,680
Without Boss,

133
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,160
none of us would be here today.

134
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:43,199
We'd all die for him.

135
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:47,079
Boss.

136
00:07:47,639 --> 00:07:48,839
We'll be brothers again
in the next life.

137
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:56,639
Natuo.

138
00:07:57,839 --> 00:07:59,040
Know why you lost?

139
00:08:00,439 --> 00:08:00,879
What?

140
00:08:01,759 --> 00:08:04,560
You'll never know what it means
to have brothers who'd die for you.

141
00:08:06,199 --> 00:08:06,879
Brothers.

142
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:09,399
If I die here today,

143
00:08:09,959 --> 00:08:11,240
I need you to do three things.

144
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:12,439
First,

145
00:08:14,439 --> 00:08:16,079
take Sihan's ashes home.

146
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:18,439
Second,

147
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:20,839
tear down Grand Royal.

148
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:23,240
Not a single brick standing.

149
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,439
Third,

150
00:08:26,319 --> 00:08:27,439
every one of you stays alive.

151
00:08:28,399 --> 00:08:29,480
Not one of you dies.

152
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,399
Enough talking!

153
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:32,759
I'll count to three.

154
00:08:33,639 --> 00:08:34,440
If you don't make a choice,

155
00:08:34,799 --> 00:08:36,600
I'll set off both.

156
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:39,720
Three.

157
00:08:46,559 --> 00:08:47,080
Two.

158
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,200
One.

159
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:19,120
You really couldn't bring yourself
to blow up Grand Royal.

160
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,279
I won the bet.

161
00:09:21,799 --> 00:09:22,360
You...

162
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,399
How did you know?

163
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,600
Because

164
00:09:25,519 --> 00:09:26,559
you're too greedy.

165
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:29,120
From the start, all you wanted
was to blow me up.

166
00:09:30,759 --> 00:09:31,159
So

167
00:09:31,639 --> 00:09:33,480
only the bomb under me is real.

168
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,399
Saying you'd blow up Grand Royal

169
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:37,879
was just a lie.

170
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:40,000
You just wanted to fool my brothers

171
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:40,879
so they wouldn't dare touch you,

172
00:09:41,519 --> 00:09:43,039
and you could get away clean.

173
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:44,720
Impossible.

174
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,519
You couldn't have known.

175
00:09:47,039 --> 00:09:48,000
I'm not like you.

176
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,720
All you care about is money and power.

177
00:09:52,639 --> 00:09:53,879
But I saw through you long ago.

178
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,200
You're just a coward.

179
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,120
You don't have the guts to risk it.

180
00:10:00,159 --> 00:10:00,879
Brothers.

181
00:10:01,679 --> 00:10:02,360
Clear the place.

182
00:10:10,159 --> 00:10:10,799
Let's move!

183
00:10:47,799 --> 00:10:48,360
Don't move!

184
00:10:51,799 --> 00:10:52,159
Daya!

185
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:09,480
Daya!

186
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,120
Daya!

187
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,080
Stay back, all of you!

188
00:11:11,799 --> 00:11:13,279
Or I'll shoot her.

189
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,600
You lowlife.

190
00:11:23,519 --> 00:11:24,600
Think tearing down one poster

191
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,639
can erase your past?

192
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:31,000
When your mother sold you here,

193
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:33,840
you were the wildest
of that whole new batch.

194
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:35,039
You were

195
00:11:35,639 --> 00:11:36,279
quite a treat.

196
00:11:36,919 --> 00:11:37,679
Remember?

197
00:11:38,159 --> 00:11:40,120
Back then, I had over a dozen guys

198
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:41,600
put you through a whole night

199
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:42,759
of "initiation."

200
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:43,919
Shut up!

201
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:45,120
Shut your mouth!

202
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,279
Natuo.

203
00:11:46,679 --> 00:11:47,759
You monster!

204
00:11:48,159 --> 00:11:49,639
Did I allow you to talk?

205
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,519
Zhou Yan.

206
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,519
You even dared touch the BlackGold Key?

207
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:05,320
You've got some nerve.

208
00:12:07,519 --> 00:12:08,759
Give it to me.

209
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,480
I might let her go.

210
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:13,159
(BlackGold?)

211
00:12:14,559 --> 00:12:14,960
Boss.

212
00:12:15,639 --> 00:12:17,679
We can figure the rest out later.

213
00:12:18,919 --> 00:12:20,080
But Daya can't get hurt.

214
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:20,759
Boss.

215
00:12:24,399 --> 00:12:24,919
You can have it.

216
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:29,480
Spare her life.

217
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,159
That's right.

218
00:12:31,159 --> 00:12:31,960
That's right.

219
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,480
Give it back to me.

220
00:12:33,919 --> 00:12:35,600
Then I'll give you

221
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,519
your little sweetheart back.

222
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:42,240
Boss!

223
00:12:43,919 --> 00:12:44,320
Boss!

224
00:12:45,519 --> 00:12:46,000
Boss!

225
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:46,840
Boss, I'm begging you.

226
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:47,919
What are you waiting for?

227
00:12:47,919 --> 00:12:48,480
Give it to him.

228
00:12:48,679 --> 00:12:49,639
Give it to him, and Daya lives.

229
00:12:50,039 --> 00:12:50,919
I'm begging you, Boss.

230
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,080
I'll get on my knees and beg.

231
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:52,720
Please?

232
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,120
Boss.

233
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:53,639
Give it...

234
00:12:53,639 --> 00:12:54,000
Fine.

235
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:54,559
Fine!

236
00:13:03,559 --> 00:13:04,039
Here.

237
00:13:06,039 --> 00:13:06,679
Take it.

238
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:07,840
Don't give it to him!

239
00:13:09,919 --> 00:13:10,399
Zhou Yan.

240
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:11,840
I was in your debt.

241
00:13:12,919 --> 00:13:13,919
Now I'm paying you back.

242
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:23,639
Daya!

243
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:40,640
♪Dust rises along the border♪

244
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:41,960
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

245
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,320
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

246
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:44,720
♪Brothers yesterday, foes today♪

247
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:46,080
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

248
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:47,400
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

249
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:48,720
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

250
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,400
♪My life is mine to bear♪

251
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:53,240
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

252
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:55,840
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

253
00:13:56,160 --> 00:13:58,160
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

254
00:13:58,160 --> 00:13:59,240
♪My fate is mine to command♪

255
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:00,520
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

256
00:14:00,760 --> 00:14:01,800
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

257
00:14:02,040 --> 00:14:03,120
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

258
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:04,400
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

259
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:05,760
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

260
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:07,080
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

261
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:08,400
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

262
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:09,680
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

263
00:14:09,920 --> 00:14:11,040
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

264
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,560
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

265
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:13,960
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

266
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:15,320
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

267
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:18,360
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

268
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:22,040
♪With blood and sweat♪

269
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:23,440
♪I forge my glory♪

270
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:24,840
♪In this world of chaos♪

271
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:25,920
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

272
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,400
♪My legend♪

273
00:14:27,400 --> 00:14:28,880
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

274
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:36,040
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

275
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:38,880
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

276
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:41,000
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

277
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:42,280
♪My fate is mine to command♪

278
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:43,560
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

279
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:52,840
♪My fate is mine to command♪

280
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:54,600
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪
